below overlap: a score of 6-8 does not by itself resolve to P0 or P1.

| Risk Score | Typical Priority | Rationale                                  |
| ---------- | ---------------- | ------------------------------------------ |
| 9          | P0               | Critical blocker (probability=3, impact=3) |
| 6-8        | P0 or P1         | High risk (requires mitigation)            |
